!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/validate/valid/a-reference-reaches-a-key-through-a-spaced-field-name-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/validate-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.12, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.2, [TSON-DATA] §2.4 (reference reach, proposed for Revision 40)"
  description: """
    A data document's reference is walked as a schema's is, each segment a name of the family of what it enters:
    `main` is a value of `site`, whose `name_type` is `word`, so `public api` selects that field, and `ping` a key
    of the `api` it holds. The name is quoted whole because a segment holds a space.
    """
  valid: _
}
